{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab. Check properties, move to destination and do specific task. Otherwise, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />\"",
